            "body": "Closes #28\n\n---\n\n# \ud83d\ude80 ACTA Pull Request\r\n\r\nMark with an `x` all the checkboxes that apply (like `[x]`)\r\n\r\n- [x] Closes #\r\n- [x] Added tests (if necessary)\r\n- [x] Run tests\r\n- [x] Run formatting\r\n- [x] Evidence attached\r\n- [x] Commented the code\r\n\r\n#closes 28\r\n\r\n### \ud83d\udccc Type of Change\r\n\r\n- [x] Documentation (updates to README, docs, or comments)\r\n- [x] Bug fix (non-breaking change which fixes an issue)\r\n- [x] Enhancement (non-breaking change which adds functionality)\r\n- [x] Breaking change (fix or feature that would cause existing functionality to change)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## \ud83d\udcdd Changes description\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## \ud83d\udcf8 Evidence (A Loom/Cap video is required as evidence, we WON'T merge if there's no proof)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## \u23f0 Time spent breakdown\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## \ud83c\udf0c Comments\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThank you for contributing to ACTA! We hope you can continue contributing to this project.\r\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Full-featured media library admin (search, filters, pagination, bulk edit/delete)\n  * Image upload with optional Stellar hash anchoring and automated optimization/variants\n  * Orphaned-media detection, rescan and cleanup UI\n  * Cover image picker and article cover support; media detail modal with edit/delete\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Storage schema, buckets, and access policies added\n  * Dev/editor config and dependency updates (image processing, Stellar SDK, CLI script)\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
